== diags.diag/input-paren-braceless-body
BYN1017 3:11 parentheses around a condition are an input form
  label not needed
  help remove the parentheses
  fix 3:11-3:25 x == 0 { x = 1 }
BYN1018 3:20 the body of `while` must be a block
  label a single statement
  help wrap the statement in `{ }`
BYN1017 4:8 parentheses around a condition are an input form
  label not needed
  help remove the parentheses
  fix 4:8-5:24 x > 2 { print("big") }
    else { print("small") }
BYN1018 4:16 the body of `if` must be a block
  label a single statement
  help wrap the statement in `{ }`
BYN1018 5:10 the body of `else` must be a block
  label a single statement
  help wrap the statement in `{ }`
BYN1007 6:5 `unless` with a negated condition is a double negative
  label `unless` already negates
  help use `if` with the condition as written
  fix 6:5-6:36 if (x > 0) { print("none") }
BYN1018 6:23 the body of `unless` must be a block
  label a single statement
  help wrap the statement in `{ }`
